a 2018 destination wedding also and are looking in the same areas! We are planning a site visit to the Cancun\/Playa Del Carmen area in November and will be visiting Generations Riviera Maya as that is on our list as well. Keep in touch and I'll share pictures\/reviews when I go.. we are also looking at Hyatt Ziva Cancun, Beach Palace, Azul Beach, and Secrets Maroma.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of Luck!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>M<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megan.higgins512@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.171.135.170","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471980117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287610.jpg?_r=1472011295","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"motevoli","Id":287610,"Name":"motevoli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"120.16.206.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6bdf156adfacef8e6106a55f1656980","RawContent":"2018 seems so far away but when you have to plan a wedding.. It&#039;s not too far away!\n\n\nI&#039;m planning on a July wedding in Thailand in 2018! So excited. struggling to find some information on wedding planners though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1915536,"PostDate":1472766670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                20