Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.212.125.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18c8056914e8ed607b68f464aca583cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in 2018 as well but no date yet. It&#039;s hard to be engaged for awhile before setting a date because of all the questions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917669,"PostDate":1494008481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are getting married in 2018 as well but no date yet. It's hard to be engaged for awhile before setting a date because of all the questions!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hmanson10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.212.125.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1494006753,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hmanson","Id":288830,"Name":"hmanson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.83.48.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b281ce9d764f9f210289356a8aabab9","RawContent":"hiiii... I&#039;m also a 2018 bride... may 2018 to be exact. and yea the more resorts you look the more options and the harder your decision will be.. however I don&#039;t think you can go wrong with any to be honest.. im getting married at Royalton Riviera Maya ( the wedding packages were perfect for what I wanted ).... my booking was super smooth, and all the rooms have been booked already... now I just feel like I got too much time in my hands for the actually planning. maybe start looking for a dress? color palettes ? flowers? I still have plenty of time I think ..\n Anyways GOOD LUCK ![quote name=\"Stacsoontobeegan\" post=\"1915492\" timestamp=\"1472497852\"]\nHey fellow brides, any ladies planning their 2018 wedding? I&#039;ve been engaged for over a year now (shhh I know absolutely ridiculous \ud83d\ude39) I finally started planning and decided on a destination wedding. I&#039;m 99% sure we&#039;re doing Generations Riviera Maya. How everyone&#039;s planning going? Mines gone easy thus far, I was lucky enough to snag a wedding planner who lives in Mexico!! \ud83c\udf89 Hope to hear from some brides who are planning!!\n\n-stacey[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1917775,"PostDate":1496235762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hiiii... I'm also a 2018 bride... may 2018 to be exact. and yea the more resorts you look the more options and the harder your decision will be.. however I don't think you can go wrong with any to be honest.. im getting married at Royalton Riviera Maya ( the wedding packages were perfect for what I wanted ).... my booking was super smooth, and all the rooms have been booked already... now I just feel like I got too much time in my hands for the actually planning. maybe start looking for a dress? color palettes ? flowers? I still have plenty of time I think ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Anyways GOOD LUCK !<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Stacsoontobeegan, on 29 August 2016 - 11:10 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey fellow brides, any ladies planning their 2018 wedding? I've been engaged for over a year now (shhh I know absolutely ridiculous \ud83d\ude39) I finally started planning and decided on a destination wedding. I'm 99% sure we're doing Generations Riviera Maya. How everyone's planning going? Mines gone easy thus far, I was lucky enough to snag a wedding planner who lives in Mexico!! \ud83c\udf89 Hope to hear from some brides who are planning!!<br><br>\n-stacey<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anabel0227@gmail.com","IpAddress":"206.83.48.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1495976926,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288939.jpg?_r=1496070518","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"xxanabelitaxx","Id":288939,"Name":"xxanabelitaxx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.98.106.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1496928005,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"971276055abc8900bd97936bca932b57","RawContent":"I got engaged in May of 2017. We are thinking about Playa Fiesta in Puerto Vallarta, Mexico. We are leaning towards November 2018!\n[quote name=\"MrsDickerson2016\" post=\"1915806\" timestamp=\"1475174706\"]\nHi, I&#039;m also planning to get married in August 2018. I haven&#039;t decided on a location yet because I keep changing my mind. I&#039;m stuck between Saint Lucia and Dreams (Cancun). I really need to make up my mind. I want a beautiful location with decent packages and to customize will not break the bank. HELP!! lol  :)[\/quote]My fianc\u00e9 and I got engaged in St. Lucia. It is really an incredible island. We stayed at the Landings in Gros Islet. There was a large Hindu wedding during one of the nights we were there. It looked like the resort did an awesome job!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917827,"PostDate":1496928076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got engaged in May of 2017. We are thinking about Playa Fiesta in Puerto Vallarta, Mexico. We are leaning towards November 2018!<br \/><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-time=\"1475174706\" data-cid=\"1915806\" data-author=\"MrsDickerson2016\"><p>Hi, I'm also planning to get married in August 2018. I haven't decided on a location yet because I keep changing my mind. I'm stuck between Saint Lucia and Dreams (Cancun). I really need to make up my mind. I want a beautiful location with decent packages and to customize will not break the bank. HELP!! lol\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/blockquote>My fianc\u00e9 and I got engaged in St. Lucia. It is really an incredible island. We stayed at the Landings in Gros Islet. There was a large Hindu wedding during one of the nights we were there. It looked like the resort did an awesome job! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicole.vital@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"172.58.153.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1496925355,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288985.jpg?_r=1496956084","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Avtexadelphia","Id":288985,"Name":"Avtexadelphia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.231.187.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8620afdff10aff25289d712dc4f75bb4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have officially decided on our resort for our Wedding on 4.14.18 at Ocean Riviera Paradise in Playa del Carmen! Its a brand new resort that opened in December of 2016, and of course there are NO wedding resort reviews so after reading resort guest reviews and reviews from my Travel Agent who went there and loved it, I decided to go for it! Wish us luck!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone else having their wedding at this resort? Would love to hear your thoughts or concerns!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917934,"PostDate":1500488069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have officially decided on our resort for our Wedding on 4.14.18 at Ocean Riviera Paradise in Playa del Carmen! Its a brand new resort that opened in December of 2016, and of course there are NO wedding resort reviews so after reading resort guest reviews and reviews from my Travel Agent who went there and loved it, I decided to go for it! Wish us luck!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else having their wedding at this resort? Would love to hear your thoughts or concerns!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blavelle@me.com","IpAddress":"97.116.145.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1494870052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288864.jpg?_r=1500517264","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":237,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beelave","Id":288864,"Name":"beelave","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.141.126.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98dc62857d255d6ff84d080a733b4688","RawContent":"[quote name=\"xxanabelitaxx\" post=\"1917775\" timestamp=\"1496264562\"]\nhiiii... I&#039;m also a 2018 bride... may 2018 to be exact. and yea the more resorts you look the more options and the harder your decision will be.. however I don&#039;t think you can go wrong with any to be honest.. im getting married at Royalton Riviera Maya ( the wedding packages were perfect for what I wanted ).... my booking was super smooth, and all the rooms have been booked already... now I just feel like I got too much time in my hands for the actually planning. maybe start looking for a dress? color palettes ? flowers? I still have plenty of time I think ..\n Anyways GOOD LUCK ![\/quote]Oh, we were between Royalton or Now Jade and visted both in December.  The Royalton was so beautiful and the food was AMAZING!  Enjoy!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917976,"PostDate":1501147663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>xxanabelitaxx, on 31 May 2017 - 01:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>hiiii... I'm also a 2018 bride... may 2018 to be exact. and yea the more resorts you look the more options and the harder your decision will be.. however I don't think you can go wrong with any to be honest.. im getting married at Royalton Riviera Maya ( the wedding packages were perfect for what I wanted ).... my booking was super smooth, and all the rooms have been booked already... now I just feel like I got too much time in my hands for the actually planning. maybe start looking for a dress? color palettes ? flowers? I still have plenty of time I think ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Anyways GOOD LUCK !<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh, we were between Royalton or Now Jade and visted both in December. \u00a0The Royalton was so beautiful and the food was AMAZING! \u00a0Enjoy!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kantisavage@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.141.126.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469441318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287452.jpg?_r=1501173110","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kateleigh","Id":287452,"Name":"kateleigh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.95.156.218","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"559f7c48556b6e05bb6686a3f2728d78","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kaleykapri\" post=\"1917457\" timestamp=\"1490205984\"]\nI&#039;m April, 2018 bride - we just selected azul fives by karisma as our location - i read tons of great things about the resort and helps that my mom is a travel agent as well! anyone else doing azul fives?[\/quote]Im planning on it!! I keep looking at oth3rs but something keeps pulling me back there... what made the deal for you?\n\nSent from my SM-G920W8 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1917991,"PostDate":1501324357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kaleykapri, on 22 March 2017 - 10:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm April, 2018 bride - we just selected azul fives by karisma as our location - i read tons of great things about the resort and helps that my mom is a travel agent as well! anyone else doing azul fives?<\/p><\/div><\/div>Im planning on it!! I keep looking at oth3rs but something keeps pulling me back there... what made the deal for you?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G920W8 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexandra-howard@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.178.219.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1501234583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"turtlemama","Id":289177,"Name":"turtlemama","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"138.68.139.136","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6f48461750ec576a0b2425dc51b5b75","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Stacey, we&#039;re aiming for June 2018. So far we&#039;ve decided it&#039;ll be a destination wedding and we want a nautical wedding but that&#039;s about it. Still looking around for information. I wanted a wedding in a vineyard with just a few people but I happen to see a blog on nautical wedding and it was so pretty! Should be able to finalize the theme in a couple of months.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918134,"PostDate":1504683160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Stacey, we're aiming for June 2018. So far we've decided it'll be a destination wedding and we want a nautical wedding but that's about it. Still looking around for information. I wanted a wedding in a vineyard with just a few people but I happen to see a blog on nautical wedding and it was so pretty! Should be able to finalize the theme in a couple of months.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carla.macahilig@gmail.com","IpAddress":"130.105.234.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1504682061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CarlaNM","Id":289311,"Name":"CarlaNM","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
