nbsp;I am so excited to just start this journey to planning a destination wedding in Cabo! &amp;nbsp;We are looking to book something very affordable but also something that makes sense and is all in inclusive and simple.. does anyone have any Cabo suggestions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We can&#039;t wait! &amp;nbsp;Also I would love to see photos of destination wedding dresses what is your dress inspiration? &amp;nbsp;I am struggling and feeling so bogged down with traditional gowns (which are beautiful!) which just aren&#039;t the right fit for my easy laid back ceremony... help?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917829,"PostDate":1496930534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I am so excited to just start this journey to planning a destination wedding in Cabo! \u00a0We are looking to book something very affordable but also something that makes sense and is all in inclusive and simple.. does anyone have any Cabo suggestions?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We can't wait! \u00a0Also I would love to see photos of destination wedding dresses what is your dress inspiration? \u00a0I am struggling and feeling so bogged down with traditional gowns (which are beautiful!) which just aren't the right fit for my easy laid back ceremony... help?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"emma.e.howes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.250.46.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1496929971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"EmsElizabeth","Id":288986,"Name":"EmsElizabeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28eb6e66795ab81863df881b9bdc4712","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! &amp;nbsp;My name is Patty and I am one of the Wright Travel BDW travel agents. &amp;nbsp;We are hear to help take the stress out of planning your dream destination wedding. &amp;nbsp;There are lots of great all inclusive options in Cabo for a variety of budgets. If you&#039;d like a BDW TA to contact you just click on the link below. Thanks! TA Patty&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917832,"PostDate":1497032238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! \u00a0My name is Patty and I am one of the Wright Travel BDW travel agents. \u00a0We are hear to help take the stress out of planning your dream destination wedding. \u00a0There are lots of great all inclusive options in Cabo for a variety of budgets. If you'd like a BDW TA to contact you just click on the link below. Thanks! TA Patty\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,12